  "instance_name": "metaphorical_window",
  "label": "Metaphorical Window",
  "description": "The window is used metaphorically to represent a point of view or perspective. Looking out the window implies detachment, distraction, or a failure to engage with the immediate situation or the person speaking. In this context, it symbolizes the man's refusal to engage with the woman's perspective.",
